<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Lehman cuts Anheuser-Busch.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Lehman cuts Anheuser-Busch.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers said analyst Michael Branca downgraded Anheuser-Busch Cos Inc to neutral from buy, citing the stock's price.</p>
<p>-- The stock is valued at over 18 times the analyst's new 1997 earnings estimate of $2.43 a share, down from a previous $2.45, and near his price target, a Lehman report said.</p>
<p>-- Lowered 1998 estimate to $2.67 from $2.70.</p>
<p>-- The stock was off 3/8 at 43-7/8.</p>
</text>
